{
  "name": "Danse Macabre",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>When using this skill, you may spend up to three [Fate Points] (0 is okay). You gain a +[(Spent [Fate Points] + SR) x 5] bonus to [Weapon Attack] damage rolls.</p>\n<p>(CR11): The multiplier bonus becomes x10. (CR21): The multiplier bonus becomes x15.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A special skill that unleashes continuous attacks with dance-like movements that even the enemy will be fascinated by. The trajectory of the weapon glowing with blood smoke becomes a dance of death, stealing the life of the enemy with the sword.</p>",
